From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:01:18 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Add timed daemon, alarms/notifications QML plugins, keymaps
 and locale

Complete the remaining reasonix-alignment items: package the timed server
and voland client library, add the Nemo.Alarms/Nemo.Notifications QML
plugins, ship the patched kmap2qmap keymap and supported-languages assets,
and wire the resulting user services, D-Bus policies and locale drop-in
into the asteroid desktop profile.
